                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " helps their customers go from prompt to deployed app using Managed Agents as the default integration, powering a new generation of AI-native apps. Users can now spin up that same infrastructure at least 10x quicker than before."
              },
